<title>SINGAPORE: BADMINTON-SINGAPORE OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-SINGAPORE OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Konica Cup</p>
<p>Singapore Open badminton championships:</p>
<p>Played Friday:</p>
<p>Men's singles quarter-finals</p>
<p>Sun Jun (China) beat Marleve Mainaky (Indonesia) 5-15 15-3</p>
<p>15-2</p>
<p>Indra Wijaya (Indonesia) beat Geroge Rimarodi (Indonesia)</p>
<p>15-1 15-5</p>
<p>Ardy Wiranta (Indonesia) beat Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) 15-17</p>
<p>15-9 15-6</p>
<p>Heryanto Arbi (Indonesia) beat Jason Wong (Malaysia) 2-15</p>
<p>15-4 15-7</p>
<p>Women's singles quarter-finals</p>
<p>Gong Zhichao (China) beat Yu Hua (China) 11-3 11-7</p>
<p>Kim Ji-hyun (South Korea) beat Judith Meulendijks</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 11-7 12-10</p>
<p>Zhang Ning (China) beat Lee Joo-hyun (South Korea)</p>
<p>11-4-11-7</p>
<p>Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat Pornsawan Plungwech (Thailand)</p>
<p>11-1 11-5</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p>Men's singles semifinals</p>
<p>Indra Wijaya (Indonesia) beat Sun Jun (China) 15-9 2-15 15-7</p>
<p>Heryanto Arbi (Indonesia) beat Ardy Wiranta (Indonesia) 15-10</p>
<p>15-6</p>
<p>Women's singles semifinals</p>
<p>Gong Zhichao (China) beat Kim Ji-hyun (South Korea) 11-1 11-7</p>
<p>Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat Zhang Ning (China) 11-6 11-8</p>
<p>Mixed doubles final</p>
<p>Bambang Suprianto/Rosaline Riseu (Indonesia) beat Kim</p>
<p>Dong-moom/Park So-yun (South Korea) 15-13 15-9</p>
</text>
